{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/extras/Header3_EN.png?t=1749085923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Suit up and jump into the action with the TurretGirls demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 10 days of trial battle within the game, you can try out the explosive turret system, test your reflexes, and earn your first battle-grade upgrades. Not to mention a chance at some elite gear (and maybe a fresh pair of underwear!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/extras/GIF_BattleStart.gif?t=1749085923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this high-octane on-rails shooter, you\u2019ll take command as Girl, the fearless lone gunner of P.A.N.T.S.U., humanity\u2019s last hope against a relentless alien swarm. No retreat. No mercy. Just you, your turret, and a buffet of alien scum to vaporize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/extras/GIF_Shopping.gif?t=1749085923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/extras/Header2_EN.png?t=1749085923\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742940?t=1749085923","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/7a403cb47aad8ffa7f94a711463fb15c951cb2eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749085923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742940/72cee2a5f1f6cbc79f4c93ca5619aceb8dc4405d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749085